  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...16...20 spirit. This spirit heals all party members within earshot for 3...9...10 Health each second. This spirit loses 3...9...10 Health for each party member healed in this way. This spirit dies after 30...78...90 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造一隻等級 1～20 的回春縛靈。此縛靈每秒治癒音量所及範圍的盟友 3～10 體力。此縛靈也將依照因此被治癒的每一盟友而失去 3～10 體力。回春縛靈在 30～90 秒後消失。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...13...16 spirit. This spirit heals all party members within earshot for 3...9...10 Health each second. This spirit loses 3...9...10 Health for each party member healed in this way. This spirit dies after 30...78...90 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "召喚等級 1～16 的靈體，持續 30～90 秒。每秒為聽距內所有隊友治療 3～10 體力；每治療一名隊友，靈體就失去同量體力。"
    }
  },
